  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word used in written and official contexts. In everyday conversation, {見|み}る (to look at) or {読|よ}む (to read) is more natural. {閲覧|えつらん} is commonly used in digital contexts ({閲覧|えつらん}{履歴|りれき} = browsing history) and for accessing official records.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {閲覧|えつらん}{履歴|りれき}: browsing history\n- {閲覧|えつらん}{数|すう}: view count, page views\n- {閲覧|えつらん}{制限|せいげん}: viewing restriction\n- {閲覧|えつらん}{注意|ちゅうい}: viewer discretion advised\n- {閲覧|えつらん}{可能|かのう}: available for viewing",
